Achieved 
 Modified version of the CORINE was completed;
 Training module created 
 The employees of the National Agency forSustainable Land Management and Land Use Monitoring (twelve GIS specialists) were trained on the integration of data received frompublic institutions / organizations, or various LEPLs (public registry, wine agency, forestry, protected areas);
 The technicaland software technical specifications necessary for data integration and data management were formed;
 The methods of enteringdata into GIS were defined, guidelines were developed, according to which all employees involved in the project were responsiblefor data integration in GIS.
